  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Naturv&#xe5;rdsverket st&#xf6;d NEMC Tanzania</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish EPA support NEMC Tanzania - Swedish EPA support NEMC Tanzania NS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida is planning for support to the &quot;National Environment Management Council&quot;, NEMC, in Tanzania. NEMC is Tanzania&apos;s equivalent of the Swedish Environmental Protection Agency, SEPA. The support to NEMC is appraised and agreed separately from this contribution.

This contribution intends to enable the Swedish EPA to participate in the abovementioned project with NEMC.

The project with NEMC focus mainly on strengthening the environmental regulation in Tanzania, both at central and local level, by completing missing part of the Environmental Management Act and local by-laws. Capacity building is also included, mainly on environmental impact assessments for the environmental permit process.

The Swedish EPA will assist NEMC in drafting the new legislation and advise on the development of the environmental permit process.

A comprehensive and complete environment legislation framework is a prerequisite for managing possible environmental impacts of industrial activities, public services, business and activities in sectors such as tourism, fishing and agriculture.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sida &#xf6;verv&#xe4;ger st&#xf6;d till &quot;National Environment Management Council&quot;, NEMC, i Tanzania. NEMC &#xe4;r tanzanias motsvarighet till Naturv&#xe5;rdsverket. St&#xf6;det till NEMC bereds och avtalas separat fr&#xe5;n denna insats.

Denna insats avser Naturv&#xe5;rdsverkets medverkan i projektet med NEMC.

Projektet med NEMC avser komplettera &#xe4;nnu ofullst&#xe4;ndiga delar av tanzanias motsvarighet till milj&#xf6;balken, samt tillh&#xf6;rande f&#xf6;rordningar och f&#xf6;reskrifter. &#xc4;ven insatser f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka kapaciteten hos NEMC &#xe4;r inkluderade, framf&#xf6;r allt med fokus p&#xe5; milj&#xf6;konsekvensbeskrivningar (MKB).

Naturv&#xe5;rdsverkets medverkan i projektet avser st&#xf6;d till NEMC i arbetet med kompletterande regelverk och r&#xe5;dgivning kring MKB och tillst&#xe5;ndsprocesser.

En fullgod milj&#xf6;lagstiftning &#xe4;r en f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttning f&#xf6;r att kunna hantera eventuella milj&#xf6;konsekvenser av industriell verksamhet, kommunal service, f&#xf6;retagsamhet, samt n&#xe4;ringar s&#xe5;som turism, fiske och lantbruk.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">i) To establish the status of Environmental Management Act implementation

ii) To support formulation of additional regulations and guidelines for implementation of the environmental management act in Tanzania

iii) To support LGAs (local government authorities) in formulating environmental by-laws

iv) To enhance institutional capacity for effective implementation of EMA and for monitoring and reporting of imlementation of EMA in LGAs and MDAs (ministerial departments)

v) To enhance public awareness and private sector awareness and understanding on their roles and responsibilities in implementation of EMA.

The expected outcome is that the proposed project will lead to improved state of the environment in Tanzania, through effective coordination and implementation of the key environmental legislation across government at the central and local levels.</narrative>
  </description>
